122	 * reads/writes this row. `cents` is authoritative:
123	 *   - a positive number → upsert (sets amount; keeps the reconciliation flags)
124	 *   - 0 or null         → delete the row (no buy-in)
125	 *   - undefined         → leave the amount alone, only re-sync the display name
