2	 * Merged member calendar composer (#208).
3	 *
4	 * A member's "Schedule" is ONE seamless feed. This composes it at read time from
5	 * several sources so each stays authoritative (no duplicated/drifting rows):
6	 *
7	 *   authored  — v2_schedule_items: group-level (event_id NULL) + active-event items
8	 *   derived   — one all-day span per active event (from v2_events.start/end_date)
9	 *   derived   — birthdays projected from v2_profiles.birthdate (opt-out per org)
10	 *   provided  — activity time items (tee times, auction start…) once modules exist
11	 *
12	 * Scope: group items + birthdays always; event/activity items only for events with
13	 * status='active' (per the product decision). Windowed to the recent past forward
14	 * to keep a year-spanning, multi-year feed bounded (Supabase 1000-row cap).
15	 */
16	
